{"vid":"m4xHCkB31Bg","source":"m4xHCkB31Bg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.1,"txt":"[PETER DEMARZO] The best executive education should not only change what"},{"t":3.3,"txt":"you do now, but who you become in the future."},{"t":8.8,"txt":"[GALIA GOULISHEVA] Stanford LEAD is the kind of program that will challenge"},{"t":11.7,"txt":"you to think bigger, to act bolder, and unlock"},{"t":15.3,"txt":"your leadership potential."},{"t":16.8,"txt":"[PETER DEMARZO] Stanford LEAD is an online leadership program designed for"},{"t":20.6,"txt":"mid and senior level executives around the globe, bringing them"},{"t":24.5,"txt":"together with the very top MBA professors that we have here."},{"t":28.5,"txt":"At the Stanford GSB"},{"t":29.9,"txt":"[AUSTIN RAMSLAND] You really do become part of a larger community,"},{"t":33.7,"txt":"[TIFFANY CHIN] being able to hear from people"},{"t":35,"txt":"anywhere in the world, you get a completely"},{"t":37.7,"txt":"different perspective of what's happening and what's"},{"t":40.2,"txt":"critical right at this moment."},{"t":41.6,"txt":"[GALIA GOULISHEVA] It totally exceeded my expectations in terms of"},{"t":44.6,"txt":"the learning experience, the takeaways and the"},{"t":47.4,"txt":"insights that I'm still using on a daily basis,"},{"t":50.7,"txt":"and the many wonderful connections that I formed"},{"t":53.2,"txt":"through the program."},{"t":54.4,"txt":"[TIFFANY CHIN] You are directly engaging with all of the professors."},{"t":57.5,"txt":"You can ask questions. They're so fast to respond."},{"t":60.6,"txt":"[PETER DEMARZO] The vision for LEAD was to create a transformative"},{"t":63.7,"txt":"online educational journey, not just a set of courses."},{"t":68,"txt":"[AUSTIN RAMSLAND] I use the material every single day at work."},{"t":71.2,"txt":"Hard skills to soft skills and, and everything in between."},{"t":75.3,"txt":"It is almost like having cheat codes to business."},{"t":79.3,"txt":"[GALIA GOULISHEVA] It gave me both the confidence and the leadership techniques"},{"t":82.9,"txt":"to both get promoted in my previous organization and make"},{"t":86.7,"txt":"a highly successful career move."},{"t":88.5,"txt":"[TIFFANY CHIN] That's the best part."},{"t":89.8,"txt":"You can immediately see the impact."},{"t":92.4,"txt":"[AUSTIN RAMSLAND] You are going to supercharge your skills and capabilities."},{"t":96.8,"txt":"You're gonna have a network of people on the other side."},{"t":100.2,"txt":"The person you are when you start the program and"},{"t":103.4,"txt":"the person you are when you finish the program are"},{"t":106.4,"txt":"just radically different."}],"words":[{"t":0.14,"w":"[PETER"},{"t":0.14,"w":"DEMARZO]"},{"t":0.14,"w":"The"},{"t":0.14,"w":"best"},{"t":0.14,"w":"executive"},{"t":0.14,"w":"education"},{"t":0.14,"w":"should"},{"t":0.14,"w":"not"},{"t":0.14,"w":"only"},{"t":0.14,"w":"change"},{"t":0.14,"w":"what"},{"t":3.32,"w":"you"},{"t":3.32,"w":"do"},{"t":3.32,"w":"now,"},{"t":3.32,"w":"but"},{"t":3.32,"w":"who"},{"t":3.32,"w":"you"},{"t":3.32,"w":"become"},{"t":3.32,"w":"in"},{"t":3.32,"w":"the"},{"t":3.32,"w":"future."},{"t":8.76,"w":"[GALIA"},{"t":8.76,"w":"GOULISHEVA]"},{"t":8.76,"w":"Stanford"},{"t":8.76,"w":"LEAD"},{"t":8.76,"w":"is"},{"t":8.76,"w":"the"},{"t":8.76,"w":"kind"},{"t":8.76,"w":"of"},{"t":8.76,"w":"program"},{"t":8.76,"w":"that"},{"t":8.76,"w":"will"},{"t":8.76,"w":"challenge"},{"t":11.7,"w":"you"},{"t":11.7,"w":"to"},{"t":11.7,"w":"think"},{"t":11.7,"w":"bigger,"},{"t":11.7,"w":"to"},{"t":11.7,"w":"act"},{"t":11.7,"w":"bolder,"},{"t":11.7,"w":"and"},{"t":11.7,"w":"unlock"},{"t":15.26,"w":"your"},{"t":15.26,"w":"leadership"},{"t":15.26,"w":"potential."},{"t":16.8,"w":"[PETER"},{"t":16.8,"w":"DEMARZO]"},{"t":16.8,"w":"Stanford"},{"t":16.8,"w":"LEAD"},{"t":16.8,"w":"is"},{"t":16.8,"w":"an"},{"t":16.8,"w":"online"},{"t":16.8,"w":"leadership"},{"t":16.8,"w":"program"},{"t":16.8,"w":"designed"},{"t":16.8,"w":"for"},{"t":20.58,"w":"mid"},{"t":20.58,"w":"and"},{"t":20.58,"w